<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
 <head>
  <title>Strada: Strava integration with Discord</title>
  <%= partial 'public/partials/_head.html.erb' %>
  <script src="<%=h asset_path('/scripts/register.js') %>"></script>
  <script src="<%=h asset_path('/scripts/status.js') %>"></script>
  <meta name="description" content="Connects Strava in Discord and reposts athlete and club activities into Discord channels, including time, distance, pace, map and weather."/>
  <meta property="og:title" content="Strada: Strava integration with Discord">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Connects Strava in Discord and reposts athlete and club activities into Discord channels, including time, distance, pace, map and weather.">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="Strada: Strava integration with Discord">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Connects Strava in Discord and reposts athlete and club activities into Discord channels, including time, distance, pace, map and weather.">
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "SoftwareApplication",
    "name": "Strada",
    "url": "<%= DiscordStrava::Service.url %>",
    "applicationCategory": "SocialNetworkingApplication",
    "operatingSystem": "Discord",
    "description": "Connects Strava in Discord and reposts athlete and club activities into Discord channels, including time, distance, pace, map and weather."
  }
  </script>
 </head>
  <body id="page-top" class="site-page homepage">
  <%= partial 'public/partials/_navigation.html.erb' %>
  <main id="main">
    <header class="hero">
      <div class="page-container">
        <div class="hero-intro">
          <img class="hero-logo" src="<%=h asset_path('/img/icon.png') %>" width="200" height="199" alt="Strada logo">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <h1>Strada</h1>
            <p class="hero-tagline">Make every activity a team moment.</p>
            <p class="hero-description">Bring your running or cycling club together in Discord. Share Strava activities, celebrate every finish, and keep your team moving.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <%= partial 'public/partials/_install_button.html.erb' %>
              <a class="secondary-button" href="/help.html#get-started">Get started</a>
            </div>
            <p class="beta-note">Free 2-week trial. No credit card required. Subscribe for $19.99/yr.</p>
            <p id="messages" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="hero-preview">
          <img src="<%=h asset_path('/img/notify.png') %>" width="1031" height="658" alt="Strada sharing a Strava activity with stats and a route map in Discord">
        </figure>
      </div>
    </header>
    <section id="how-to-use" class="homepage-section">
      <div class="page-container">
        <h2>How to use</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">From your next workout to your team's channel.</p>
        <ol class="setup-steps">
          <li>
            <h3>Add Strada to your server</h3>
            <p>Invite the bot to your Discord server, then choose the channel where your club gets together. Follow the <a href="/help.html#get-started">getting-started guide</a>.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Connect your Strava account</h3>
            <p>Send <code>/strada connect</code> in that channel and follow the link to authorize Strada on Strava.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Share the effort</h3>
            <p>New activities appear with time, distance, pace, and available maps and weather. Try <code>/strada leaderboard</code> and <code>/strada stats</code> to see how your team is doing.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <p><a href="/help.html">Explore commands and settings</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="open-source" class="homepage-section">
      <div class="page-container narrow-container">
        <h2>Open source</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">Built for teams. Open to everyone.</p>
        <p>Strada's Ruby code is open source under the MIT license. Report a bug, suggest a feature, or help make it better for your club.</p>
        <p><a class="secondary-button" href="https://github.com/dblock/discord-strava">View on GitHub</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="pricing" class="homepage-section">
      <div class="page-container narrow-container">
        <h2>Pricing</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">Try it free for two weeks.</p>
        <p>No credit card is required for the trial. Subscribe for $19.99/yr to keep your team moving.</p>
        <p class="install-cta"><%= partial 'public/partials/_install_button.html.erb' %></p>
        <p>Subscriptions help pay for hosting and <a href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/dblockdotorg">membership</a> with the non-profit <a href="https://www.nyrr.org/">New York Road Runners</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="contact" class="homepage-section">
      <div class="page-container narrow-container">
        <h2>About and help</h2>
        <p>Need a hand? Read the <a href="/help.html">command guide</a>, <a href="/help.html#support">contact support</a>, or <a href="https://github.com/dblock/discord-strava/issues">open an issue</a>.</p>
        <p>Looking to add Strava to <a href="https://slava.playplay.io">Slack</a> or <a href="https://strata.playplay.io">Microsoft Teams</a>?</p>
        <div class="attribution-logos">
          <a href="https://www.nyrr.org/"><img src="<%=h asset_path('/img/nyrr.png') %>" width="1200" height="450" alt="New York Road Runners" loading="lazy"></a>
          <img src="<%=h asset_path('/img/powered.png') %>" width="199" height="86" alt="Powered by Strava" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <p class="affiliation-note">Not officially affiliated with <a href="https://www.nyrr.org/">NYRR</a> or <a href="https://www.strava.com">Strava</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <%= partial 'public/partials/_footer.html.erb' %>
 </body>
</html>
